devasyāgre viśeṣeṇa nṛttageyaṃ sa tālakam || 206 ||

nīrājanaṃ prakurvīta divyastrīṇāṃ tu dhārayet |
bhasmaṃ puṣpaṃ ca dīpaṃ ca tvadbhutacchatracāmaraiḥ || 207 ||

darpaṇaṃ hemakumbhaṃ ca tripādyuparivinyaset |
