dvātriṃśat sarvapūrṇāṃ tu tadardhārdhaṃ tu meva vā || 6 ||

sūtraissaṃveṣṭayitvā tu vastreṇāveṣṭayet tataḥ |
pañcaratnāni nikṣipya ratnābhāve hiraṇmayam || 7 ||

sūtraṃ prāgeva saṅgrāhya nirmitaṃ dvijakaṃpo (*)(?) |
athavā śodhyatoyena bhasmena kṣālayet tataḥ || 8 ||

trisūtraṃ grāhayet pūrvaṃ devaṃ ca dviguṇaṃ bhavet |
navasaṅkhyā tu yatsūtraṃ pavitraṃ kārayecchubham || 9 ||

vāmī ca śaktayastatra navasūtrādhidevatā |
piṅgośodhyasya āyāmaṃ prāsāde tatpavitrakam || 10 ||

hastamātra samāyāmaṃ pavitramihaśobhanam |
sūtrairvivardhayedvidvān navadhātupavitrakam || 11 ||

